# API

- Nest + PostgreSQL + Prisma 6. Session auth + role Guards.
- Prisma client: generate to `src/generated/prisma`, import from there (not `@prisma/client`).
- After schema change: `pnpm prisma:generate`. Root `.env` only (`DATABASE_URL`).
- DTOs with `class-validator`. No bare `any` on controllers.
- Prisma only inside services — not controllers.
- Overlap checks in DB/transactions. Sources: `manual` | `website` | `booking_com` | `airbnb` | `agoda`.
- iCal updates PMS only — does not refresh OTAs.
- Read `apps/api/AGENTS.md` + `.cursor/rules/monorepo-tooling.mdc`.
